{"server":"cn","storyId":"act16side_level_act16side_03_end","groupId":"act16side","stageId":"act16side_03","title":"混血儿","storyCode":"GA-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"cca5827f5de47a205110ba1125823e09092f8876926398c95d458d4c02bac95d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"“即使会被公证所开除，我也要试一试。带塞茜莉亚去安魂教堂。至少让她说声再见。”","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g9_laterano_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们想跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没这么简单！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愉快的小贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_364_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的小贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_362_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃......我掩护你，快逃！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个佩洛竟然帮萨卡兹挡下攻击......两个，都别想跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾泽尔，你待在这儿，不许......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不许轻举妄动。我明白，菲亚梅塔小姐。终端我打开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请相信我，我想确保的只有塞茜莉亚的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我改主意了。你不能留在这里。现在，立刻送塞茜莉亚前往大教堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们就这么留在大街上......更危险。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，塞茜莉亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？我们刚才不是向着圣像走的吗，圣像在那边，艾泽尔哥哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们绕一下路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绕路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你现在要去的地方应该是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安魂教堂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g11_laterano_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们跑不掉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愉快的小贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_364_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她追得好快......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的小贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_362_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么办怎么办，根本甩不掉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愉快的小贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_364_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情因我而起......这个黎博利不可能放过我们的，你们走！我来殿后！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安静的小贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_362_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愉快的小贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_364_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"退后。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安，多，恩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别想再逃走......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我滚出来！！！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g4_laterano_cathedralliving"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真不明白，教宗阁下为什么对那帮“迷途者”如此......放任自流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提马，你能告诉我吗，既然你们认识？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不想和你谈这个话题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就这么记仇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟那时候我没死在那家伙手上，却差点被你杀了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很难忘的经历。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是你在我面前一直戴着帽子的原因？不难受吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都做了这么久万国信使了。戴帽子而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和你，多一事不如少一事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在埋怨我吗，莫斯提马？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特兰始终有拉特兰要维护的东西，也总有人要在乎这些事。我无所谓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提马，你可能稍微有些误解。很少有堕天使留在教廷，并不是因为教廷如何，而是因为那些堕天的萨科塔本身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的态度也许是有一点特别......莫斯提马，你以为自己就不是个怪胎吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这么和我说话，就不怕我变成你口中那种“正常的堕天使”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你会，就听不到我和你“这么说话”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧。说点实在的，什么时候把菲亚梅塔调走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总是跟着我，对她没好处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这句话你不和她本人说吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说过了，没用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说就有用吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据我的观察，权力的方便之处就是可以无视他人的意愿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无视他人的意愿是要付出代价的......你为什么想调走菲亚梅塔，说来听听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亚梅塔说是我的护卫，你们就不好奇我有什么需要她护卫的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，也有人觉得她是我这个堕天使的监视者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么想的人恐怕对菲亚梅塔没有丝毫了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不过是菲亚梅塔的饵，用来钓安多恩的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她要是听见你这么说，恐怕不会很开心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那我换个说法......饵是我背上这对锁与匙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以？让菲亚梅塔遂愿有什么不好吗？如果她能干掉安多恩，或者把他缉拿回大教堂，我当然乐见其成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，你们俩加一块也捉不到安多恩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒不至于。只要安多恩还惦记着锁与匙，他就逃不掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过......我在想啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果安多恩已经找到别的路了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想见到的是，我走出来了，蕾缪安走出来了，甚至安多恩都走出来了......菲亚梅塔却还陷在八年前那个雨夜里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没法和菲亚梅塔说这些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是这种时候，我会稍微怀念一下共感的好处......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，忘了菲亚梅塔是黎博利。那当我没说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是年轻的话题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，您要给我一点“过来人的教诲”吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你允许我享受一下这种属于长辈的小小特权。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您请。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还记得八年前你对我说的话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......虽然我很不想破坏这么温情脉脉的气氛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，阁下，真忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的是，“不......我还有要做的事，要保护的人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......听薇尔丽芙学我说话也太恶寒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彼时彼刻，你不愿让我替你做选择，此时此刻，你又何必要替菲亚梅塔做选择呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人的路总要自己去找，自己去选，自己去走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇尔，这也是给你的回答。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g5_laterano_chapelout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......快到了，塞茜莉亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，艾泽尔哥哥，我走得太慢了......太阳都快要落山了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亚很了不起！毕竟没办法用公共交通......我们都走到移动地块以外啦。要是我有菲亚梅塔小姐的身手和力气，你也不用这么辛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的！其实妈妈也带我出来过，我们会走到离家很远的地方......和这里也差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，菲亚梅塔姐姐不会发现我们偷偷来这里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她只是查看终端的定位信号......希望我的花招至少能争取一点时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好在还是抵达了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈就是来了这里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......塞茜莉亚，我想了很久应该怎么和你解释这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费莉亚......你的妈妈，确实来了这里，但她也不在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没办法让你再见到妈妈。但在这里，你至少可以和她告别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾泽尔哥哥......你说的......我不太明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果妈妈来了这里，又不在这里，那她是......又去了别的地方吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去了哪里呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们先进去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g6_laterano_chapelin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉特兰市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......父亲去世之前，一直希望他的葬礼上只有欢笑，不要有泪水，可我却......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温和的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_369_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，令尊真正希望的是，您不因他的离去陷入无法自拔的悲伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温和的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_369_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哭泣也好，欢笑也好，如果那就是您的道别......想必他都会欣然接受的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉特兰市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你......修士小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温和的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_369_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我陪您去外面的花田走走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾泽尔哥哥，那个姐姐说她的父亲也“去世”了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......去世的人，就会来到这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活着的人，在这里与他们道别......然后，带着对去世之人的思念，继续自己的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那去世的人呢，他们做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也许会在天上看着我们吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为去了天上，所以再也见不到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亚，给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......妈妈的守护铳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的爸爸妈妈，都是公证所的执行者。小时候我很少能见到他们......是爷爷把我带大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爷爷很喜欢他的铳，每次擦铳的时候，都会和我讲起他年轻时的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他参加过的战役，他的战友，他怎么遇到奶奶，还有我爸爸小时候的糗事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到爷爷的铳，我就会想起他讲的那些故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......后来，爷爷去世了。我那时也只比你现在大一点点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公证所的执行者，带走了他的守护铳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你母亲的守护铳，本应被我带走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"艾泽尔缓缓蹲下，将费莉亚的铳放在塞茜莉亚手中。\n塞茜莉亚低下头，看着手中母亲的守护铳。\n艾泽尔轻轻握住塞茜莉亚的手。\n温热的水滴跌落在守护铳的浮雕花纹上，流到年幼女孩的掌心，堆积成一小片水渍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾泽尔哥哥......我怎么哭了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我按爷爷教我的，每周给后院的盆栽浇水，后来它们开花了，我很高兴，喊爷爷来看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喊出声才想起来，爷爷已经不在了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再也见不到爷爷，再也没见过他的铳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死亡就是永不再会的离别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而离别本身即是对死亡的克服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"存者在此，去者在彼，才有“离别”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“离别”是生者对逝者的惦念，也因此成为逝者存在的证明。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是为何我们需要道别。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
